WEBVTT

hook
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Rhythmic music and impacts]
YOUR REACTIONS
Cat and dog memes bounce and flip around the Zapstick mark.

import
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
IMPORT
Choose a photo, GIF or video. The media appears in the preview.

link
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
ONE LINK
Paste a public link to import its media, then start customizing it.

text
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
YOUR WORDS
Add your words, choose their style and drag the text directly on the preview.

emoji
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
REACT
Pick an emoji, move it and adjust its size on the animated sticker.

background
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
NO BACKGROUND
Remove the media background, then try colored backdrops.

animation
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
THE MOMENT
Move the timeline handles to choose the moment you want to keep.

original
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
ORIGINAL SOUND
If the video contains sound, its original audio is selected on import.

second
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
TWO SOUNDS
The second sound starts after the first. When you shorten the first, the second follows it.

excerpt
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
AT 5 S
Choose the second sound’s excerpt starting at five seconds. Its position after the first sound stays the same.

collections
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
ALL SORTED
Create a collection and drag stickers into it. You can also rearrange the cards.

favorites
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:36.000
YOUR FAVORITES
Tap the heart to find your favorite stickers quickly.

export
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.000
READY TO GO
Download an animated GIF without sound, or an MP4 video with sound.

party
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:52.000
AGAIN!
The memes mix and bounce: a reaction for every mood.

signature
00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:00.000
ZAPSTICK
Zapstick. Create your next reaction.
